    "regime_notes": "Full available 2020-2029 sample; 752 valid 5-day cross-sectional observations with at least 8 names per date. Daily IC and ICIR also pass the benchmark gates at the 5-day horizon. Earlier regime split was unavailable in the executed aligned sample because the returned dataset begins in the later period; later 2026-2029 observations remained positive but weaker. Interpret uncertainty conservatively given the 15-asset universe and effective coverage limitations.",
